\pard\b \f0\fs22 General principles\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Internal standard code: POL-2024-0051.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Any incident must be reported to the internal contact within twenty-four hours.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Digital records are retained for seven years unless a different legal period applies.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Information is classified as public, internal, confidential, or restricted according to the impact of improper disclosure.\par
\pard\b \f0\fs22 Policy review\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Backups are verified monthly through a restore test.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Exceptions must be documented, justified, and approved by the responsible director.\par
\pard\li360 \f0\fs22 Record access and reviews in one central system.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 This document does not replace specialised legal or technical advice.\par
